<title>USA: Sherwin-Williams buys St. Louis paint firm.</title>
<headline>Sherwin-Williams buys St. Louis paint firm.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwin-Williams Co said Tuesday it has acquired the primary assets of Brod-Dugan Co of St. Louis for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Brod-Dugan manufactures and sells coatings and related products to contractors and retail customers through 13 paint stores in the St. Louis area.  It will become part of Sherwin-Williams Paint Stores Group but will continue to operate under the Brod-Dugan name and sell Brod-Dugan products.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
